description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, MAC blacklist/whitelist, scheduling, SMS forward, Mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark notifications, hidden SSID, device diagnostics. Primarily tested on Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16. v1.7.4-beta: MAC whitelist, data exhaustion forecast, device adaptation check; v1.7.5-beta: stability fixes (proxy default scope hotspot, MAC policy cleanup); v1.7.3-beta: hidden SSID.
